WEBVTT

00:19:28.011 --> 00:19:32.201
It's anything that can be reproduced
in a mind and spread,

00:19:32.225 --> 00:19:35.378
including big, beautiful, powerful ideas.

00:19:35.402 --> 00:19:40.862
I just -- for someone who didn't like,
in full, your form of magical thinking

00:19:40.886 --> 00:19:42.562
but wanted to be creative,

00:19:42.586 --> 00:19:48.374
the notion of being open to
the unique combination of memes

00:19:48.398 --> 00:19:52.787
that could form in your own mind
and reproduce and be shared more broadly

00:19:52.811 --> 00:19:55.173
and to see yourself as --

00:19:55.197 --> 00:19:59.498
you know, your role in the world
is to be in service of those memes.

00:19:59.522 --> 00:20:00.698
EG: Yes.